# 00 - Intro: version + full command tour
Output "clips/00-intro.mp4"
Set Width 1440
Set Height 900
Set FontSize 16
Set Padding 24
Set TypingSpeed 30ms
Set Shell bash

Type "cd ../cli-app"
Enter
Sleep 600ms
Type "export VECTALON_DEV_MODE=1"
Enter
Sleep 400ms
Type "node ../../../../packages/rn/bin/rn-vectalon.js --version"
Enter
Sleep 1200ms
Type "node ../../../../packages/rn/bin/rn-vectalon.js --help"
Enter
Sleep 5000ms
Sleep 3s
